<title>UK: Sterling edgy ahead of by-election result.</title>
<headline>Sterling edgy ahead of by-election result.</headline>
<byline>Julia Meehan</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling was choppy in Europe, flirting with 2.75 marks, as the market awaited the result of a key British Parliamentary by-election which threatens to push the Conservatives into a minority government.</p>
